00:03:13.896 --> 00:03:15.896
Yes. To investigate.


00:03:17.396 --> 00:03:21.096
I’m here to investigate your odd...
predicament.


00:03:21.996 --> 00:03:24.797
Do you find the odd?
Your predicament?


00:03:26.697 --> 00:03:28.197
Michael?...


00:03:28.997 --> 00:03:30.697
I don’t know.


00:03:32.097 --> 00:03:33.798
